% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
% Part: Orientation — the practical front matter (manual, playbook,
% output routing), placed first so a reader can arrive quickly.
% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
\part{Orientation}

\noindent Before the book builds the compiler from the language standard down 
to the running binary, three chapters orient the reader who wants to arrive 
quickly: how to \emph{use} \kcc{}, how to \emph{extend} it to a new
architecture, and how its many fragments are \emph{assembled} into the physical 
files the machine requires.

@i literate/appendices/A-user-manual.weft
